{"seq":4,"slug":"dependencies-and-maintenance","title":"Dependencies And Maintenance","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-build-and-tooling/dependencies-and-maintenance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dependency-management","title":"依赖管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-build-and-tooling/dependencies-and-maintenance/dependency-management","wordCount":1976,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"keeping-tooling-healthy","title":"保持工具链健康","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-build-and-tooling/dependencies-and-maintenance/keeping-tooling-healthy","wordCount":1819,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"documenting-the-toolchain","title":"把工具链写进上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-build-and-tooling/dependencies-and-maintenance/documenting-the-toolchain","wordCount":1852,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲工具链的依赖与长期维护:依赖管理(锁定版本、可复现安装、依赖精简清晰),让环境一致、让 agent 能正确地用和加依赖;保持工具链健康(别让构建慢慢腐烂、依赖过期、工具失修),让这个 agent 赖以工作的环境长期顺畅;以及把工具链写进上下文(在 AGENTS.md 说清怎么装、怎么跑、怎么验、有哪些命令),让 agent 一上来就知道怎么在这个项目里工作。\n"}